---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Refund & Cancellation Policy | Aju House">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12 py-16 md:py-24">
        
        <nav class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-400 mb-8">
            <a href="/" class="hover:text-black transition-colors">Home</a>
            <span>/</span>
            <span class="text-gray-900">Refund Policy</span>
        </nav>

        <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-5xl font-medium text-gray-900 tracking-tight mb-8">Refund & Cancellation Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold mb-12 border-b border-gray-100 pb-4">Returns & Claims Overview</p>

        <div class="space-y-10 text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed font-light">
            
            <section class="space-y-3">
                <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-medium text-gray-900">1. Non-Returnable Products</h2>
                <p>Due to personal hygiene, health safety, and the artisanal nature of fine fragrances and fitted mobile accessories, <strong>we do not accept returns or exchanges for change of mind once an item has been dispatched or unsealed</strong>.</p>
            </section>

            <section class="space-y-3">
                <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-medium text-gray-900">2. Damaged, Defective, or Incorrect Shipments</h2>
                <p>If your package arrives damaged in transit or if an incorrect item was dispatched, we will issue a replacement or full refund under the following conditions:</p>
                <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-xs text-gray-600">
                    <li>You must notify us within <strong>48 hours</strong> of package delivery.</li>
                    <li>A clear, unedited <strong>unboxing video</strong> showing the outer parcel label, seal breaking, and physical defect must be provided for claim verification.</li>
                </ul>
            </section>

            <section class="space-y-3">
                <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-medium text-gray-900">3. Order Cancellations</h2>
                <p>Orders can be canceled only if a request is submitted before the parcel has been handed over to our courier partner. Once a shipment status updates to "Shipped", cancellations are not possible.</p>
            </section>

            <section class="space-y-3">
                <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-medium text-gray-900">4. Refund Processing Window</h2>
                <p>Approved refunds are processed back to the original payment method (via Razorpay) within <strong>5 to 7 business days</strong> following inspection and approval.</p>
            </section>

            <section class="space-y-3 pt-6 border-t border-gray-100">
                <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-medium text-gray-900">5. Submit a Claim</h2>
                <p>Send your unboxing video along with your Order Reference ID to:</p>
                <div class="bg-gray-50 p-6 border border-gray-100 rounded-sm text-xs space-y-1 font-mono">
                    <p class="font-bold text-gray-900">Claims & Care Desk</p>
                    <p>Email: perfumesaju@gmail.com</p>
                    <p>WhatsApp: +91 8075304432</p>
                </div>
            </section>

        </div>
    </div>
</Layout>